  "notes": "{疑|うたが}う is a transitive godan verb meaning to doubt, question, or suspect.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n{他動詞|たどうし} (transitive) - takes を for the object of doubt.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {目|め}を{疑|うたが}う: to doubt one's eyes (can't believe what you see)\n- {耳|みみ}を{疑|うたが}う: to doubt one's ears (can't believe what you hear)\n- {疑|うたが}いなく: without doubt, undoubtedly\n- {疑|うたが}いをかける: to cast suspicion on\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {疑|うたが}い: doubt, suspicion (noun)\n- {疑問|ぎもん}: question, doubt\n- {疑惑|ぎわく}: suspicion, distrust\n- {半信半疑|はんしんはんぎ}: half in doubt",
